  <downloads>7487</downloads>
  <installedfile>/home/cristo/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.github.chrtall.kppleMenu/</installedfile>
  <id>2164679</id>
  <releasedate>2024-06-12</releasedate>
  <summary>&lt;p>The Kpple menu is a drop-down menu that is usually found on the left side of the menu bar.&lt;br />The original maintainer does not seem actively maintaining the project anymore. In order to port the plasmoid to KF6 I created this fork.&lt;br />I also added Keyboard Navigation via Tab and Back-tab or via Arrow Keys.&lt;br />The user can also Lock Screen by pressing:  CTRL + ALT + Q when the applet is expanded.&lt;br />The users can also Log Out by presssing: SHIFT + ALT + Q when the applet is expanded.&lt;br />A shortcut for the applet can be set via the settings menu.&lt;/p></summary>
  <changelog></changelog>
